sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant User as LINE User
 participant LINE as LINE Platform
 participant Bot as Bot Handler
 participant Id as Identity + Scope
 participant DB as SQLite
 participant CH as ClickHouse
 participant Conv as Conversation
 participant MCP as MCP Data Server
 participant LLM as LLM Gateway

 Note over User,LLM: 1. Webhook intake - ack BEFORE the model runs

 User->>LINE: types a text question
 LINE->>+Bot: POST /webhooks/line<br/>x-line-signature
 Bot->>Bot: verify HMAC (LINE_CHANNEL_SECRET)

 alt signature invalid
 Bot-->>LINE: 401 Invalid signature
 Note over LINE: nothing is sent to the user
 else signature valid
 Bot-->>-LINE: 200 { ok: true }<br/>(returned before any LLM call)
 Note over Bot: work continues detached<br/>because LLM + tool latency<br/>can exceed LINE's reply window
 Bot->>Bot: handleTextEvent(event)

 Note over User,LLM: 2. Authorization - grants resolved server-side

 Bot->>+Id: resolveLineIdentity(userId)
 Id->>+DB: SELECT liff user + grants
 DB-->>-Id: principal or none

 alt unknown user or no grants
 Id-->>Bot: not permitted
 Bot->>DB: recordPendingLiffAccessRequest()
 Bot->>LINE: pushMessage: Thai no-permission notice
 else permitted
 Id-->>-Bot: AccessScope { branchIds, canViewRevenue }
 Note over Bot,Id: the user's own claim never
 Note over Bot,Id: chooses a branch

 Note over User,LLM: 3. Agentic answer - off the webhook

 Bot->>+CH: listBranchNames (allowed only)
 CH-->>-Bot: branch context
 Bot->>+Conv: answerForMessage(text, role, scope)
 Conv->>DB: getAiSettingsWithKey()
 DB-->>Conv: baseURL / model / prompt
 Conv->>+MCP: listTools(scope)<br/>x-mcp-scope (signed)
 MCP-->>-Conv: allow-listed tool descriptors
 Note over Conv,MCP: 401 INVALID_SCOPE / 403 SCOPE_MISMATCH<br/>on a bad scope signature

 Note over User,LLM: 4. MCP tool round-trip

 Conv->>+LLM: streamText: system prompt + tools
 LLM-->>-Conv: tool_call (bounded by maxSteps = 2)
 Conv->>MCP: callTool(name, args, scope)
 MCP->>CH: parameterized reporting query
 CH-->>MCP: rows
 MCP-->>Conv: tool result text
 Conv->>+LLM: feed tool result back
 LLM-->>-Conv: assembled Thai answer

 Note over User,LLM: 5. Answer pushed, not replied

 Conv-->>-Bot: answer text
 Bot->>+LINE: pushMessage(to: userId)
 Note over Bot,LINE: reply token has already expired
 LINE-->>-User: answer appears in the chat

 alt LLM or tool throws
 Conv-->>Bot: error
 Bot->>Bot: log error
 Bot->>LINE: pushMessage: Thai retry notice
 end
 end
 end
